# Keep the root surface intentionally small: one checkpoint installer, two
# instance selectors, one stop command, one internal launcher, and recovery assets.
*
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!install-abliterated.sh
!start-original.sh
!start-abliterated.sh
!stop.sh
!lib/
!lib/serve-dflash.sh
!tests/
!tests/*.sh
!patch/
!patch/**
